        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For the services provided to these managed accounts, we are paid gross annual base management or advisory fees of approximately 1.5% plus a gross annual performance fee of 20% of cash-on-cash returns in excess of an 8% hurdle.",
