        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2019, we acquired a 45% interest in CK Capital, a private company incorporated in the Netherlands, which provides asset and investment advisory services relating to real estate holdings, as well as a 10% interest in a related real estate holding company.",
